        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "One thing to quickly note is: annotations are largely ignored at global scope because it implies making the variable cdef which ends up making it invisible to Python.\n\n(I could imagine that could change in future with module-level properties. But likely not soon)\n\nI wonder if the annotation is doing something unhelpful like redeclaring it as a regular Python variable",
